             CarbajalTinoko cites the 2008 paper instead, contradicting the
             Table I of the paper that accompanies it -- and this project's
             implementation, which came from that package down to the
             Tinoko spelling, inherited the wrong attribution. The 2008
             paper is the source of EXTENDED ROGERS-YOUNG, a different
             closure also implemented here; reading it while looking for
             this formula finds Eq. 13 and no trace of the bridge function
             above, which is how the error was caught},
}

